. Rank up your ninja from Styrofoam tier to Silver, Gold, and beyond, beating down the opposition with your superior scoring skills! Show off your mastery with newly added Steam Achievements!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/849680/extras/05f7188dd07c5166d44bebc09c80f674.webp?t=1661493090\" width=611 height=40 /></span><br><strong>Multiple difficulty modes, ranging from balanced to absolutely impossible! </strong> <br>From people new to shoot em' ups to the most hardcore veterans of the genre, TimeTekker has something for everybody.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/849680/extras/aaae6f568da143c616f885af054158ec.webp?t=1661493090\" width=611 height=40 /></span><br>This game started as a prototype in Quinnipiac University's GDD Program, but after a year of development, it's become more than I ever imagined. I hope you enjoy this little homage to all the shoot em' up games that I grew up with. Happy scoring!<br><br><i>- Ryan O'Hara, Artii Games LLC</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/849680/extras/6219203fe88056fbb5f323b21f9d2024.avif?t=1661493090\" width=600 height=162 /></span>","developers":["Artii Games LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/849680/header.jpg?t=1661493090","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> tested on &quot;Manjaro&quot;<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Celeron CPU N2840<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></l